 - Added handling for empty notification lists

4. Updated FirebaseRepository:
 - Added error handling for notification retrieval
 - Made it return an empty flow instead of throwing exceptions

These changes make the notification system more robust and should resolve the permission error. If the Firebase rules can't be deployed directly from your machine, you'll need to manually update them in the Firebase Console with the new rules we created.

